# .cursorrules — youtube-downloader

**Canonical project context:** [`AGENTS.md`](AGENTS.md)  
**Workspace rules:** [`../../AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md)  
**Hermes-only overrides:** [`.hermes.md`](.hermes.md) → [`../../.hermes.md`](../../.hermes.md)

- Inspect local `AGENTS.md`, `pyproject.toml` / `package.json`, and existing code before editing.
- Python CLI only: 4-space indent, double quotes, snake_case; Ruff 120; prefer `ruff check .` and `pyright .`.
- No `any` (if TS appears), no backup files, no `.env` writes, no inventing APIs or verification results.
- Surgical changes; preserve unrelated worktree modifications.
- Multi-file protocol (≥5 files): [`../../SOUL.md`](../../SOUL.md) canonical block.
